        "original_id": "7c1b641c-0791-5628-9aa2-a7f9eb5b47d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Dukes of Hazzard, Moonrunners\n- People: Gy Waldron, James Mitchum, Denver Pyle\n- Characters: Briscoe Darling Jr.\n- Topics: character-name and concept similarities, bootlegging\n\nFacts:\n- Moonrunners is a 1975 film about a Southern family that runs bootleg liquor, and it stars James Mitchum.\n- Gy Waldron created the 1975 film Moonrunners.\n- The series The Dukes of Hazzard was inspired by the 1975 film Moonrunners.\n- The Dukes of Hazzard and Moonrunners had many identical or similar character names and concepts.\n- Denver Pyle portrayed the character Briscoe Darling Jr..\n- Denver Pyle was also known for playing Grandpa Tarleton on Tammy, Buck Webb on The Doris Day Show, and Uncle Jesse on The Dukes of Hazzard.",
